{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/s9d2ec","slide":6,"text":"The mission supervisor exposes the project navigation actions and coordinates Nav2 clients. NavFn computes the path, Simple Smoother refines it, and RPP produces the upstream Twist request. Costmaps combine the map, robot footprint and front/rear perception data. This is a request path, not the final authority path.\n\nSources:\n- src/amr_mission/src/mission_supervisor_node.cpp\n- src/amr_navigation/config/planner.yaml\n- src/amr_mpc_controller/config/controller.yaml"}
