{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/8zbwx6","slide":7,"text":"The factory supervisor loads the product and station registries, validates them and owns the high-level action results. Navigation reaches stations through the mission boundary. The cycle supervisor coordinates the manipulation stage, and MoveIt plans arm trajectories. Evidence gates prevent a cycle from accepting inconsistent tag, contact, pose or attachment data.\n\nSources:\n- src/amr_factory/src/factory_supervisor_node.cpp\n- src/amr_factory/config/products.yaml\n- src/amr_factory/config/stations.yaml\n- src/amr_manipulation/scripts/cycle_manipulation_supervisor.py\n- src/amr_manipulation/launch/move_group.launch.py"}
